<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77159" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάμ-φῡλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλή, φῦλον</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of mingled tribes</i> or <i>races</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					291a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					9.21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. θῆρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					1063
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πάμφυλοι, οἱ</span>, one of the three Dorian tribes, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.68
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				42(1).71.49
			</span></i> (Epid.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1025.8
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cos</span>), etc.: gen. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Παμφυλᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					4.598
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Argos</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Παμφύλεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					1027.4
				</span></i>
			 (Cos.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<u>Pamphylian</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.28
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				614b
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
